  "description": "TUNRIG crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C71 H63 Dy5 N12 O24,C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.768-4.439 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.66-134.37°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(L1)2(μ3-OH)(CH3COO)6(CH3OH)3]·CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
